@baseUrl = http://localhost:5178
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Upload a TXT file and analyze word frequencies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TextAnalyzerBoundary

--TextAnalyzerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello world. Hello programming!
--TextAnalyzerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="analysisType"

Frequency
--TextAnalyzerBoundary--

### Get task history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Get task details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Get saved analysis result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/result

### Verify missing task returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
